<section background-color="heading">
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item colspan="36" vertical-align="center">
      <p role="eyebrow">The Invisible Shield Club</p>
      <h1 font-size="44pt">The sky has an invisible shield</h1>
      <p font-size="lg">Sunlight brings light and warmth. High above the weather, ozone absorbs much of the Sun’s harmful ultraviolet, or UV. Join the club: see the shield, test what it changes and learn how people protect it.</p>
      <spacer mode="fixed" size="20pt"/>
      <p font-size="sm">Source: <a href="https://www.unep.org/news-and-stories/press-release/ozone-layer-recovery-track-helping-avoid-global-warming-05degc">UNEP ozone assessment</a></p>
    </grid-item>
    <grid-item colspan="24" padding="0">
      <ai-image background="true" image-style="atmosphere-cut-paper" aspect-ratio="portrait" prompt="Layered cut-paper editorial science illustration of Earth curving across the lower right, cloud-white land beneath a thin shield-blue atmospheric arc, several UV-gold sunlight paths arriving from the upper left with some ending in the blue region and some continuing, deep-ink outer space, clean vector-like edges, subtle paper fibers, bright optimistic mood, no text or lettering"/>
    </grid-item>
